## ⚡ QUICK REFERENCE CHECKLIST

Before submitting ANY code, verify:
- [ ] Type hints on all parameters and return values
- [ ] No `print()` — using `logger` instead
- [ ] No hardcoded strings — all from config
- [ ] Atomic file writes
- [ ] Random delays on all browser interactions
- [ ] Specific exception catching (no bare `except:`)
- [ ] Test exists for this function
- [ ] `pathlib.Path` instead of string path manipulation
